  "description": "High-performance tensor operations with SIMD acceleration for .NET. Provides Vector, Matrix, and Tensor types with hardware-accelerated operations (Sin, Cos, Exp, Log, etc.) that work across .NET Framework 4.7.1 and .NET 10.0. Supports any numeric type via generic INumericOperations interface. Optional GPU acceleration available via separate packages.",
